    "out": "feat(parser): support nested placeholder\n  groups|Adds a recursive descent path for %(...)\n  forms so that option lists can themselves\n  contain commas inside quoted values.\n\n  Refs: #412 Signed-off-by: Ada Lovelace\n  <ada@example.org> Co-authored-by: Alan Turing\n  <alan@example.org>\n",
